ar1only1", "author_id": "68674772642", "id": "17916826371468157", "text": "Can you make a video about how to optimize different meshes using the same material and reduce draw calls", "timestamp": 1793159043, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "zanderfogle", "author_id": "2285037019", "id": "17966621229196536", "text": "Good idea. But wouldn\u2019t vertex colors be easier?", "timestamp": 1793153854, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "_visniciu", "author_id": "2871255078", "id": "18132672115762011", "text": "can you make a uv unwrapping guide for programmers and non artists? have been thinking to migrate from 2d to 3d but damn the workflow is hard", "timestamp": 1793153238, "like_count": 18}, {"author": "crypto_x_echo", "author_id": "33623104020", "id": "18113292110124366", "text": "Your videos are so fucking good\ud83e\udd79", "timestamp": 1793149056, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "haru4fn", "author_id": "62841398324", "id": "17912090079511950", "text": "\ud83d\ude2e\ud83d\ude2e", "timestamp": 1793141291, "like_count": 1}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfAykyuuEpk/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfAykyuuEpk/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfAykyuuEpk", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/869558437_1450814770347846_6918896407433583894_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ig_cache_key=NDAxNzQzMzI5ODMxMjEyMDkzMjE0NTA4MTQ3NjcwMTQ1MTM%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMDQuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=fOmZx9W0NQ0Q7kNvwFGmHyl&_nc_oc=AdoX21-91dkgWUp5rLk9LN6BARjvX1jTGSLtJkIQ1zQwAf1Y7nm-LODZVuk1Wuw1WLM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=YMMSqvSvrWos6-PTAdDxAg&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQRhWTo3PTPMAQntx_Evb5pz9duGIFfXl9IWLPO2H03VZQ&oe=6AE8A856", "display_id": "DfAykyuuEpk", "fulltitle": "Video by 